    "warnings": [
      "The proof account traces the Bessel and Chiti inputs through PPW but lists the strict fourth-ratio conclusion without its decisive step. The recorded proof assumes the negation of strictness, constructs a line field from the resulting spectral configuration, and rules it out by a topological contradiction. Describe that step in the informal proof account; the PPW inequality and equality case alone do not explain the strict conclusion."
    ]
